{"path":"biology/homeostasis/nerve/nerve-regulation","title":"神经调节","type":"knowledge","html":"<h1>神经调节</h1>\n<h2>反射与反射弧</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>神经调节的基本方式：<strong>反射</strong>（在中枢神经系统参与下，对内外刺激作出的规律性应答）；</li>\n<li>反射弧五部分：感受器 → 传入神经 → 神经中枢 → 传出神经 → 效应器；</li>\n<li>判断技巧：<strong>有神经节的是传入神经；切断实验</strong>：切断后刺激近中枢端无反应 → 切断的是<strong>传出</strong>神经（刺激外周端无反应 → 切断的是<strong>传入</strong>神经）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>兴奋在神经纤维上的传导（电信号/局部电流）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>静息电位：<strong>外正内负</strong>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 外流，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通道开放）；</li>\n<li>动作电位：<strong>外负内正</strong>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Na^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内流，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Na^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通道开放）；</li>\n<li>兴奋以<strong>电信号</strong>（局部电流）形式双向传导（在离体纤维上）；</li>\n<li>电流方向：膜外由未兴奋→兴奋（正→负），膜内由兴奋→未兴奋；</li>\n<li>电位变化曲线：静息（-70mV）→ 去极化（Na⁺内流，+35mV）→ 复极化（K⁺外流）→ 恢复。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>兴奋在神经元之间的传递（突触）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>突触结构：突触前膜 + 突触间隙 + 突触后膜；</li>\n<li>传递过程：突触小泡（神经递质）→ 突触前膜 → 突触间隙（扩散）→ 突触后膜（受体）→ 下一个神经元兴奋或抑制；</li>\n<li>特点：<strong>单向传递</strong>（只能从突触前膜到突触后膜），比神经纤维传导<strong>慢</strong>；</li>\n<li>神经递质：乙酰胆碱（兴奋性）、多巴胺、甘氨酸（抑制性）；作用后被降解或回收（否则持续兴奋）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>分级调节与高级中枢</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>大脑皮层：最高级中枢（语言、感觉、运动）；脊髓：低级中枢（膝跳反射）；</li>\n<li>高级中枢对低级中枢有<strong>调控</strong>作用（如憋尿：高级中枢控制低级中枢）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>邪修提示</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>电位图题：<strong>&quot;外正内负是静息，外负内正是兴奋&quot;</strong>，看到图先标内外电荷；</li>\n<li><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Na^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通道阻断剂：阻断 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Na^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内流 → 不能产生动作电位；阻断 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 外流 → 静息电位异常；</li>\n<li>电流表偏转判断：刺激后两个电极先后兴奋 → 偏转 2 次方向相反；同时兴奋 → 不偏转（膜内外电流抵消——其实同侧同时兴奋不偏转）；</li>\n<li>突触传递方向判断：看图找&quot;突触小泡&quot;在哪一侧（突触前膜侧）；</li>\n<li>风险：兴奋在<strong>神经纤维上</strong>双向、在<strong>突触间</strong>单向——&quot;在反射弧中只能单向&quot;是因为突触。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":null,"evilHtml":null,"meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":["反射弧","静息电位","动作电位","突触","兴奋传导"],"summary":"神经调节 反射与反射弧 神经调节的基本方式： 反射 （在中枢神经系统参与下，对内外刺激作出的规律性应答）； 反射弧五部分：感受器 → 传入神经 → 神经中枢 → 传出神经 → 效应器； 判断技巧： 有神经节的是传入神经；切断实验 ：切断后刺","fit":[],"updated":"Wed Feb 05 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"homeostasis","title":"稳态与调节"},{"slug":"nerve","title":"神经调节"},{"slug":"nerve-regulation","title":"神经调节"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"nerve-potential","title":"神经电位与电流方向（口诀秒杀）","type":"example"},{"slug":"reflex-arc","title":"反射弧的组成与结构基础","type":"example"}]}